# Evidence must survive a checkout byte for byte.
#
# internal/compat/testdata holds a real .adfir package produced by a
# released binary, and the test asserts its SHA256SUMS still verifies. Git's
# end-of-line conversion would rewrite the JSON and JSONL inside it on a
# Windows checkout and break every hash — which is exactly what it did.
# Nothing under here is text as far as git is concerned.
internal/compat/testdata/** -text -diff
